{"id":56,"title":"惠崇春江晚景","dynasty":"宋","author":"苏轼","lines":[{"text":"竹外桃花三两枝，","pinyin":"zhú wài táo huā sān liǎng zhī","chars":[{"char":"竹","pinyin":"zhú"},{"char":"外","pinyin":"wài"},{"char":"桃","pinyin":"táo"},{"char":"花","pinyin":"huā"},{"char":"三","pinyin":"sān"},{"char":"两","pinyin":"liǎng"},{"char":"枝","pinyin":"zhī"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"春江水暖鸭先知。","pinyin":"chūn jiāng shuǐ nuǎn yā xiān zhī","chars":[{"char":"春","pinyin":"chūn"},{"char":"江","pinyin":"jiāng"},{"char":"水","pinyin":"shuǐ"},{"char":"暖","pinyin":"nuǎn"},{"char":"鸭","pinyin":"yā"},{"char":"先","pinyin":"xiān"},{"char":"知","pinyin":"zhī"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"蒌蒿满地芦芽短，","pinyin":"lóu hāo mǎn dì lú yá duǎn","chars":[{"char":"蒌","pinyin":"lóu"},{"char":"蒿","pinyin":"hāo"},{"char":"满","pinyin":"mǎn"},{"char":"地","pinyin":"dì"},{"char":"芦","pinyin":"lú"},{"char":"芽","pinyin":"yá"},{"char":"短","pinyin":"duǎn"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"正是河豚欲上时。","pinyin":"zhèng shì hé tún yù shàng shí","chars":[{"char":"正","pinyin":"zhèng"},{"char":"是","pinyin":"shì"},{"char":"河","pinyin":"hé"},{"char":"豚","pinyin":"tún"},{"char":"欲","pinyin":"yù"},{"char":"上","pinyin":"shàng"},{"char":"时","pinyin":"shí"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]}],"titlePinyin":["huì","chóng","chūn","jiāng","wǎn","jǐng"]}